          </div>
          <div class="haul-card">
            <h4 data-en="Heavy debris (priced separately)" data-es="Escombros pesados (precio aparte)">Heavy debris (priced separately)</h4>
            <p data-en="Concrete, dirt, brick, asphalt shingles. Allowed but quoted on a different line because they fill weight before volume." data-es="Concreto, tierra, ladrillo, tejas de asfalto. Permitidos pero cotizados en una línea aparte porque llenan el peso antes que el volumen.">Concrete, dirt, brick, asphalt shingles. Allowed but quoted on a different line because they fill weight before volume.</p>
